1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
AI furnished this room.
It knows what must stay clear.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:05,000
Request: Add work and movies.
Keep the doorway clear.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,500
First, it maps the room
and the doorway.

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:14,000
Then it builds spaces to work
and watch movies.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,733
Put the sofa here?

6
00:00:17,733 --> 00:00:20,000
Stop—it blocks the doorway.

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,267
The Agent picks a safer spot.

8
00:00:23,267 --> 00:00:25,000
Sofa placed. Doorway clear.

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,733
Now press “Cinema Mode.”

10
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,000
TV and lights respond together.

11
00:00:33,067 --> 00:00:34,733
Changed your mind? Undo.

12
00:00:34,733 --> 00:00:36,000
Bring it back with Redo.

13
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,200
Not a rendered image.

14
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:40,000
Editable, inspectable, ready to change.
